ien  they manage to get into the base where a  ceremony is taking place and they  discover lauraleen is being brought as a  sacrifice to the alien king  she almost gets her head chopped while  valyrian and bubble intervene and show  off their fighting skills killing the  king and his men they attempt to escape  but they are confronted by another group  of aliens they eventually managed to  escape through a vent with bubble  however bubble was wounded in the  process  as she dies valerian tells her that she  is the greatest dancer he has ever seen  because of the commander's absence the  minister orders the general to take the  command and grants him full access to  fill its data the couple travel deeper  to the center of alpha until they  discover a colorful barrier  they break through the barrier and are  welcomed by the pearl's emperor and his  wife  it is revealed that princess leo  deliberately chose valerian to be the  guardian of her soul before she died  having tells them that planet mole was  once a true paradise until it was  destroyed because of a brutal war  happening outside the planet he reveals  that it was commander phillip who called  out the order to strike a gigantic alien  spaceship with special missiles causing  it to fall down and demolish the entire  planet he adds that the survivors made  it out by hiding in a half-destroyed  ship they adapted and learned languages  mathematics etc they ended up in alpha  and finally realized that they can  rebuild their own world with a pearl and  a converter which both valerian and  lauraleen possess have been states that  they have forgiven humans for destroying  their home  he then wakes the commander up and he  admits that he had to do it major samk  warned him but the commander kept  insisting on launching the airstrike  phillip then decided to kill sam to  eliminate any living witnesses  lauraleen convinces valerian to give  them the converter and disobey the order  to give it back to their superiors  using these two items the pearls rebuild  a mini planet mole within their  spaceship  outside the barrier the general's army  arrives plants explosive bombs and hold  their position waiting for a command  on the other side valerian and laura  lean attempt to call the general  requesting to call off the assault the  general believes them  however phillip orders his k-tron robot  to attack everyone outside the barrier  killing several pearls and soldiers  valerian shows up and joins the fight  eliminating the k-tron the pearls  managed to leave with their spaceship on  time  luckily the countdown is stopped before  the bombs destroy the pearl's home for  the second time  meanwhile the general orders his men to  arrest commander philip for the crime he  had committed at the end of the movie  valerian once again proposes to  lauraleen with a pearl this time she  accepts the proposal and the two of them  kiss  subscribe to watch more videos like this  turn on notifications and leave a like  to help the channel out thank you for  watching
 

